0 -14 Td
(----------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Small enterprises often face difficulties obtaining formal credit. Government-supported) Tj
0 -14 Td
(mechanisms include credit guarantees and credit-linked programmes intended to reduce) Tj
0 -14 Td
(financing constraints for eligible enterprises.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
