0 -14 Td
(-----) Tj
0 -14 Td
(The Prime Minister's Employment Generation Programme supports the creation of) Tj
0 -14 Td
(micro-enterprises and self-employment through its programme framework. It is associated with) Tj
0 -14 Td
(promoting first-generation entrepreneurship in rural and urban areas.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Technology and Quality) Tj
0 -14 Td
(----------------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(MSME programmes support modernisation, technology improvement, quality certification and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(improved production capabilities. Smaller firms may need external support because they have) Tj
0 -14 Td
(limited capital and specialist capacity.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Market Access) Tj
0 -14 Td
(-------------) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Marketing support, procurement opportunities, trade events and digital channels can help) Tj
0 -14 Td
(enterprises reach customers. Policy also encourages clusters and collective approaches that) Tj
0 -14 Td
(can provide shared infrastructure and services.) Tj
0 -14 Td
