0 -14 Td
(loan and later repay it; these stages should not be reported as one credit) Tj
0 -14 Td
(coverage figure. The same distinction applies to subsidy applications, approvals) Tj
0 -14 Td
(and disbursements. Employment estimates may count direct workers, temporary) Tj
0 -14 Td
(workers or jobs expected from an investment, so the definition and reporting) Tj
0 -14 Td
(period matter. A cluster can have stronger production capacity while individual) Tj
